  "description_short": "Cosy Glentana spot serving hearty South African comfort food with genuine country hospitality.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away in the quiet coastal village of Glentana, Blou Kombuis brings proper home-style cooking to the Garden Route. The menu celebrates South African comfort food done right, with generous portions and flavours that feel like Sunday lunch at your ouma's house. The relaxed atmosphere and friendly service make it a favourite with locals and visitors alike.\n\nThe location in Riverside puts you just a stone's throw from Glentana Beach, making it an ideal stop after a coastal walk or a day exploring the area. The kitchen takes pride in classic dishes prepared with care, and the warm welcome keeps people coming back. It's the kind of place where you'll want to linger over coffee and koeksister.\n\nWhether you're passing through on the N2 or spending time in this peaceful corner of the Garden Route, Blou Kombuis offers honest food and a genuinely welcoming atmosphere without any fuss or pretense.",
